  <!-- 2. HOW AN INQUIRY PROCEEDS -->
  <section class="section ground-surface" id="process" data-moment="pinned-chapters" style="--h: 2" aria-labelledby="process-h">
    <div class="wrap mo-pc__grid">
      <div class="mo-pc__text">
        <span class="eyebrow">How an inquiry proceeds</span>
        <h2 id="process-h">How an institutional inquiry proceeds</h2>
        <p class="t-lead">Every inquiry is read by a partner, not passed down. Nothing is delegated to a relationship desk, and nothing leaves the firm without a name against it.</p>
        <ol class="mo-pc__steps">
          <li class="mo-pc__step">
            <h3>You write to the desk</h3>
            <p>State who you are, which mandate you are looking at, and the size and timeline you have in mind. The form below carries the details we need to answer properly.</p>
            <figure class="mo-pc__visual"><img src="assets/web/card-1600.jpg" alt="The firm's business card: the EC monogram pressed in silver on a dark card" width="1600" height="892" loading="lazy"></figure>
          </li>
          <li class="mo-pc__step">
            <h3>A partner reads it</h3>
            <p>Your note goes to the partner whose background matches the mandate. You get a reply from a person, within two working days, and a straight answer on what the firm can and cannot do.</p>
            <figure class="mo-pc__visual"><img src="assets/web/cufflink-1600.jpg" alt="The firm's silver cufflink on a linen cuff, the EC monogram struck into the face" width="1600" height="892" loading="lazy"></figure>
          </li>
          <li class="mo-pc__step">
            <h3>The mandate conversation</h3>
            <p>Where there is a fit, the partner walks you through the methodology, the capacity and the terms, and the strategy dossier follows with the evidence behind it.</p>
            <figure class="mo-pc__visual"><img src="assets/web/folio-1600.jpg" alt="A leather portfolio on a granite table, the monogram pressed into the cover" width="1600" height="892" loading="lazy"></figure>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="mo-pc__visuals frame"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3. THE INQUIRY GATEWAY -->
  <section class="section" id="inquiry" aria-labelledby="inquiry-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid fill">
        <div class="span-6">
          <span class="eyebrow">Institutional inquiry gateway</span>
          <div class="section-head">
            <h2 id="inquiry-h">Contact the investment committee</h2>
            <p>Use the form, or write to the desk directly. Both reach the same partner.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="offices">
            <div>
              <p class="label">Registered head office</p>
              <address>First Floor, 145 Second Street, Parkmore<br>Sandton, Johannesburg, 2196<br>South Africa</address>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="label">Direct lines</p>
              <address><a href="tel:+27646866741">+27 64 686 6741</a><br><a href="tel:+27714435132">+27 71 443 5132</a></address>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="label">Official email</p>
              <address><a href="mailto:info@euclideancapital.co.za">info@euclideancapital.co.za</a></address>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="span-6 start-7">
          <div class="gate-panel">
            <form class="form" action="mailto:info@euclideancapital.co.za" method="post" enctype="text/plain" data-endpoint="" data-sent="Your inquiry is with the investment team. A partner replies within two working days." novalidate>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="f-name">Full name and title</label>
                <input id="f-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required aria-describedby="f-name-err">
                <p class="field__error" id="f-name-err" hidden>Write the name the inquiry is under.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="f-org">Allocating organisation</label>
                <input id="f-org" name="organisation" type="text" autocomplete="organization" required aria-describedby="f-org-err">
                <p class="field__error" id="f-org-err" hidden>Write the organisation the inquiry is for.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="f-email">Institutional email</label>
                <input id="f-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" required aria-describedby="f-email-err">
                <p class="field__error" id="f-email-err" hidden>Write an email address with an @, like name@example.com.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="f-tel">Direct telephone</label>
                <input id="f-tel" name="telephone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" aria-describedby="f-tel-err">
                <p class="field__error" id="f-tel-err" hidden>Write a telephone number, or leave it empty.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="f-interest">Mandate interest</label>
                <select id="f-interest" name="interest" required aria-describedby="f-interest-err">
                  <option value="">Choose one</option>
                  <option>Public securities strategy</option>
                  <option>Unlisted capital and direct real assets</option>
                  <option>Institutional co-investment opportunities</option>
                  <option>Geoeconomic and sovereign research access</option>
                  <option>General fiduciary inquiry</option>
                </select>
                <p class="field__error" id="f-interest-err" hidden>Choose the mandate you are asking about.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="f-reason">Reason for contacting</label>
                <select id="f-reason" name="reason" required aria-describedby="f-reason-err">
                  <option value="">Choose one</option>
                  <option>Request a confidential strategy dossier</option>
                  <option>Schedule an investment methodology walkthrough</option>
                  <option>Listed equity or hedge mandate inquiry</option>
                  <option>Unlisted or private capital co-investment</option>
                  <option>General institutional inquiry</option>
                </select>
                <p class="field__error" id="f-reason-err" hidden>Choose the reason for your inquiry.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="field field--wide">
                <label for="f-notes">Mandate scope and message</label>
                <textarea id="f-notes" name="notes" aria-describedby="f-notes-err"></textarea>
                <p class="field__error" id="f-notes-err" hidden>Write the mandate, the size and the timeline you have in mind.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="field field--wide consent">
                <input id="f-popia" name="popia" type="checkbox" required aria-describedby="f-popia-err">
                <label for="f-popia">I consent to Euclidean Capital (Pty) Ltd processing my personal information to respond to this inquiry in accordance with the Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA, Act 4 of 2013).</label>
                <p class="field__error" id="f-popia-err" hidden>Consent is required before the inquiry can be sent.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="btn-row"><button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Send the inquiry request</button></div>
              <p class="form__status" role="status" data-form-status></p>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4. THE DISCLOSURES -->
  <section class="section ground-inverse" id="disclosures" aria-labelledby="disclosures-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="group">
        <span class="eyebrow">Governance &amp; statutory compliance</span>
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 id="disclosures-h">Frequently asked questions</h2>
          <p>Statutory credentials, discretionary mandates and regulatory oversight disclosures, written out in full.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="group">
        <div class="grid fill">
          <div class="faq span-6">
            <div class="faq__item" id="fsca">
              <h3><svg class="faq__mark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.4 9.2 8 11 4.6-1.8 8-6 8-11V5z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg> FSCA statutory disclosure and licensing credentials</h3>
              <p>Euclidean Capital (Pty) Ltd is an authorized Financial Services Provider operating under the Financial Advisory and Intermediary Services Act (FAIS), adhering strictly to Category II discretionary mandate guidelines and fiduciary oversight standards in South Africa. We manage investment portfolios across listed equities and unlisted assets with full operational separation and risk controls.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq__item" id="fais">
              <h3><svg class="faq__mark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5"/><path d="M9 13h6"/><path d="M9 17h4"/></svg> FAIS general disclaimer and institutional notice</h3>
              <p>All investment products, commentary and strategies discussed are intended exclusively for qualifying institutional clients, professional allocators and accredited high-net-worth investors. Information provided does not constitute an offer, solicitation or recommendation to acquire any security, nor does it guarantee future returns.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq__item" id="popia">
              <h3><svg class="faq__mark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="10" width="16" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/></svg> POPIA privacy, data governance and cookie framework</h3>
              <p>Full compliance with the Protection of Personal Information Act 4 of 2013 (POPIA). Personal data collected through digital correspondence or mandate documentation is encrypted, held securely, and processed solely for verified institutional communication and regulatory record-keeping.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq span-6 start-7">
            <div class="faq__item" id="paia">
              <h3><svg class="faq__mark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v14H4z"/><path d="M8 9h8"/><path d="M8 13h5"/></svg> PAIA Section 51 compliance manual</h3>
              <p>Manual prepared in terms of Section 51 of the Promotion of Access to Information Act 2 of 2000 (PAIA), setting out procedures for requesting corporate records, ownership structures and regulatory disclosures from our Information Officer.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq__item" id="coi">
              <h3><svg class="faq__mark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v18"/><path d="M5 7h14"/><path d="m5 7-3 6a3 3 0 0 0 6 0z"/><path d="m19 7-3 6a3 3 0 0 0 6 0z"/></svg> Conflict of interest management policy</h3>
              <p>Strict conflict identification, mitigation and reporting frameworks pursuant to FAIS Board Notice 80 of 2003. Euclidean Capital maintains absolute segregation of proprietary activities, independent third-party custodianship and client mandate execution to prevent conflicts of interest.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq__item" id="complaints">
              <h3><svg class="faq__mark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v12H8l-4 4z"/><path d="M8 10h8"/><path d="M8 13h5"/></svg> Complaints resolution and treating customers fairly</h3>
              <p>Structured dispute resolution framework ensuring the six TCF fairness outcomes. Formal complaints are logged, acknowledged within 48 hours and addressed within prescribed regulatory timelines. Clients retain the unencumbered right to escalate unresolved matters to the Office of the FAIS Ombud.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

